  "liner": {
   "body_md": "Mountain Goats performed a 23-song set at The Wilma Theater in Missoula, MT on December 1, 2025 [1][2]. This show is number 445 in the archive's collection for the band [3]. The setlist included rare tracks like \"Romans,\" which appeared for the first time in 86 archived shows [3]. Other less common songs included \"Overture,\" \"The Lady From Shanghai,\" and \"Cold at Night\" [3]. The performance was captured by Lance Stack, who documented the recording chain [1][2]. The recommended file is a matrix mix that combines soundboard audio with audience microphones [1]. This recording offers a complete capture of the evening's lineup [1]. The band had previously played at The ELM on November 30, 2025 [3]. Visual materials for the event are credited to Logjam Presents [4][5][6][7][8]. The audio was processed through a Zoom F6 recorder before being converted to a high-resolution FLAC format [1][2]. This specific recording provides a balanced perspective of the live experience [1]. Listeners can expect a full hour and a minute of music [1]. The setlist spans various albums and rarities, with \"Romans\" being a notable highlight [3]. The recording was transferred and mixed by the same individual who taped it [1][2]. This entry offers a reliable snapshot of the band's performance in Montana [1][3].",
